<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_熬过难关、促成交易、完成与泡汤 (Endurance, Completion & Failure — '走完整个过程')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 39 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>经历，经受，仔细检查</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>experience, see</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> go or live through<div class='ex-sent'>“We had many trials to go through”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 1/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>做完</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>complete, finish</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> finish a task completely<div class='ex-sent'>“I finally got through this homework assignment”</div></td></tr>
