<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>经历...仍活着，安然度过</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>reach, attain</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> succeed in reaching a real or abstract destination after overcoming problems<div class='ex-sent'>“We finally got through the bureaucracy and could talk to the Minister”</div></td></tr>
