<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 3/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>经历...仍活着，胜利</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>succeed, win</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> attain success or reach a desired goal<div class='ex-sent'>“The enterprise succeeded”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 4/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>经历...仍活着，胜利</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>survive, overcome</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> continue in existence after (an adversity, etc.)<div class='ex-sent'>“He survived the cancer against all odds”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>搞成，接通</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>connect, link</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> connect by telephone<div class='ex-sent'>“the operator put a call through to Rio”</div></td></tr>
