<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>carry <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>实现</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>accomplish, execute</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put in effect<div class='ex-sent'>“carry out a task”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>follow <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>实现，使生效，执行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>implement, complete</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pursue to a conclusion or bring to a successful issue<div class='ex-sent'>“Did he go through with the treatment?”</div></td></tr>
