<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>pull <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>渡过难关</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>survive, overcome</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> continue in existence after (an adversity, etc.)<div class='ex-sent'>“He survived the cancer against all odds”</div></td></tr>
