<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>break <span class='pt-highlight'>through</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>爆裂，裂开，发出爆裂声</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>crack</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pass through (a barrier)<div class='ex-sent'>“Registrations cracked through the 30,000 mark in the county”</div></td></tr>
